# Used when the build context is the REPO ROOT (docker/Dockerfile.multistage).
# The per-module Dockerfiles use ./<module> as context and copy only target/<module>.jar, so the
# context is small anyway. Keep the context small: everything sent here is uploaded to the daemon.
.git
.gitignore
.idea
.vscode
*.iml
.DS_Store
**/target
.mvn/wrapper/*.jar
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
perf/results
verify-report-*.txt
postman
deploy
docs
**/node_modules
.scannerwork
